Package: hako-love
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: love, liblove0
Replaces: love, liblove0
Description: LÖVE 12 (SDL3) game framework for hako
 LÖVE built from an upstream development snapshot (12.0, SDL3).
 Debian ships 11.x, which is SDL2-based; this package replaces it.
 Games run as `love <game dir or .love>` from a hako .app file.
